// # Unified 3D Topography, Spatial Indexing & Geospatial GIS Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 3D topography, terrain analysis, geodetic datums, LiDAR, and spatial indexing modules.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API importing all companion submodules in gis_topo.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular H3, S2, GeoTIFF DEM, Map Projections, 3D R-Tree, TIN, and LiDAR submodules.
//   2. Re-export public spatial configurations, factory constructors, and topographic solver shims.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA geospatial applications.

